        <section class="features" id="featuresSection">
            <div class="feature-card">
                <span class="feature-icon">⏱️</span>
                <h3 class="f-title">Focus Timer & Live Activities</h3>
                <p class="f-desc">Stay away from phone distractions. Keep track of focus session countdowns seamlessly with Lock Screen Live Activities and Dynamic Island integrations.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <span class="feature-icon">🐱</span>
                <h3 class="f-title">Companion Growth System</h3>
                <p class="f-desc">Earn focus coins to feed and bathe your pet. Guide them from cute baby stages up to adulthood, experiencing unique companionship milestones.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <span class="feature-icon">🌈</span>
                <h3 class="f-title">Burial Hall & Offspring</h3>
                <p class="f-desc">Give your senior pets a peaceful send-off at the Heaven Memorial Hall. Keep their legacy alive by adopting and raising their offspring.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <span class="feature-icon">🐾</span>
                <h3 class="f-title">Adopt Local</h3>
                <p class="f-desc">Connect with real-world local animal shelters. Find contact details and donation sites directly to support real shelter companions natively.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="pricing">
            <h2 id="pricingTitle">Get ZenPaw+ Premium</h2>
            <p class="pricing-subtitle" id="pricingSubtitle">Unlock unlimited virtual companion care, extra slots, and support shelter pets.</p>
            <div class="pricing-grid">
                <div class="pricing-card">
                    <div>
                        <div class="price-name" id="p1Name">Pro Monthly</div>
                        <div class="price-amount" id="p1Price">$3.79</div>
                        <ul class="price-features" id="p1Features">
                            <li>Unlock salon service & hotel</li>
                            <li>Enable custom widget templates</li>
                            <li>Unlock Face ID privacy lock</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                    <a href="#" class="btn btn-secondary p-btn">Subscribe Now</a>
                </div>
                <div class="pricing-card premium">
                    <div>
                        <div class="price-name" id="p2Name">Pro Annual</div>
                        <div class="price-amount" id="p2Price">$22.90</div>
                        <ul class="price-features" id="p2Features">
                            <li>Includes 1-Week Free Trial</li>
                            <li>Unlock all salon & hotel styles</li>
                            <li>Face ID lock & Widgets</li>
                            <li>Save 50% compared to monthly</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                    <a href="#" class="btn btn-primary p-btn">Start Free Trial</a>
                </div>
                <div class="pricing-card">
                    <div>
                        <div class="price-name" id="p3Name">Pro Lifetime</div>
                        <div class="price-amount" id="p3Price">$56.90</div>
                        <ul class="price-features" id="p3Features">
                            <li>One-time purchase, forever pro</li>
                            <li>Family Sharing enabled</li>
                            <li>Supports real animal shelters</li>
                            <li>Lifetime updates included</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                    <a href="#" class="btn btn-secondary p-btn">Unlock Lifetime</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="privacy-cta">
            <h3 id="privacyCtaTitle">Local-First Privacy Architecture</h3>
            <p id="privacyCtaDesc">ZenPaw values your privacy above all. All focus logs, statistics, and companion pet data are securely processed locally using Apple SwiftData. Zero tracker, zero account setup required.</p>
            <a href="privacy.html" class="btn btn-secondary" id="btnLearnPrivacy">Read Privacy Policy</a>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <div class="footer-links">
            <a href="privacy.html" id="linkFooterPrivacy">Privacy Policy</a>
